  "details": "tracker's position that TrackedDeviceIndex >= 16 not updated. It appears at position 0,0,0.\nThe cause of this problem seems to be that k_unMaxTrackedDeviceCount is 64, but SteamVR_TrackedObject.EIndex is only up to Device15 (15).\n(Device16 was added later. https://github.com/ValveSoftware/steamvr_unity_plugin/commit/b96c786b4a17089a988fafd1541ab953f2e2e651#diff-f4c3c3b44d42b7ffd28f801cf8e2c5fb6784121817275c809949af116cfa7431R33 )\nVRChat only supports tracking up to 11 points, so you might think this is a good number. But TrackedObject includes HMD, Base station, and SteamVR does not reuse index of disconnected device until restart SteamVR.\nIn my case, there is HMD, 4 basestations, two oculus controllers, two index controllers, and 8 trackers.\n(oculus controllers is not used. \nonly for calibration)\nIn this case, index of the last tracker is 16.",
